menu "AirGradient Wi-Fi"

    config AG_WIFI_DHCP_TIMEOUT_MS
        int "DHCP acquisition timeout (ms)"
        range 1000 60000
        default 15000
        help
            Maximum time WifiManager waits between L2 association
            (IP_EVENT_STA_GOT_IP not delivered yet) and DHCP / static IP
            being applied. ESP-IDF does not expose a DHCP-failure event,
            so the manager arms an internal timer when the STA associates
            and cancels it when the IP is acquired. On expiry the manager
            normalises the disconnect reason to WifiDisconnectReason::dhcp_failed
            and treats it as non-retriable.

endmenu
